  "id": "reiki",
  "term": "reiki",
  "definition": "Reiki is a non-invasive complementary modality used in community and hospital settings, with reported benefits for lowering stress and pain. In mental health contexts, it is discussed as a supportive approach that may improve psychological as well as physical well-being.",
